              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Eegi sunile worra Filistitini akasuma Gobuti woli had'ani duuba Elhanani, ilmi Yairi, ka Bethlehemu bahe, Goliathi, ka worra Gathi, ka Someeti woraana isaa haga utuba geetu had'e ijeese.",
          "type": "text",
